<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>A script that use the csgo bug called "Jumbug or crouchbug" can help doing a difficult movement with this script.
Its not 100% consistent but works about 75% of the time.

To use it simply set it to "Run once" and enjoy,, the script will do the rest for you!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 44 1
Delay 0 ms
KeyUp 44 1
Delay 718 ms
KeyDown 224 1
Delay 15 ms
KeyUp 224 1
WheelDown 1
Delay 7 ms
WheelDown 1
Delay 7 ms
WheelDown 1
Delay 7 ms
WheelDown 1
Delay 7 ms
WheelDown 1
Delay 7 ms
WheelDown 1
Delay 7 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>CS: GO</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>